# 统一换行符，避免 Windows / macOS 协作时出现"整个文件都被改了"的假 diff

# 默认：文本文件在仓库里统一用 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须 CRLF，否则 PowerShell 5.1 可能解析异常
*.ps1   text eol=crlf
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.cmd   text eol=crlf

# 扩展清单是 XML，LF 即可
*.xml   text eol=lf
*.jsx   text eol=lf
*.js    text eol=lf
*.html  text eol=lf
*.css   text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf

# 二进制文件不要动
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.zip   binary

# Release 页面的 diff 统计里隐藏这些
CHANGELOG.md  linguist-documentation
LICENSE       linguist-documentation
